# LASER+RICOCHET (built-in)
training 0x797B7874 "LASER+RICOCHET"
builtin

step "-Hold {laser} to suck in nearby gems."  until laser_charge >= 3
step "-Release to shoot a LASER."             until laser >= 2
step "-Suck in multiple gems and ricochet the LASER off the ground to lock on to a target." until laser_lock_on >= 2

keep 1 gem at 0 10 -20 every 1
keep 1 scuttles every 1
